  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Winter Resilience: Providing Vital Heating needs for the Most Vulnerable Earthquake-Affected IDPs and residents in Altinozu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main Goal: Contribute to increase the resilience of the earthquake-affected population in Turkiye to extreme winter weather. Objectives: Improve access to variety of winterization assistance among the earthquake-affected population in Hatay province to enhanced protection of cold weather. Results: 300 HH of the earthquake-affected population in Hatay province/ Altinozu district, receive good quality heater and 300 kg of pyrene fuel per household along with Bim cards one-off.</narrative>
  </description>
